  "ID": "50630",
  "post_title": "Emotiva processó del Crist de la Clemència a Suera abans de la pluja",
  "post_date": "2014-10-27 22:17:23",
  "post_name": "emotiva-processo-del-crist-de-la-clemencia-a-suera-abans-de-la-pluja",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Nombroses persones han participat la nit d&#39;aquest dilluns en la process&oacute; del Crist de la Clem&egrave;ncia fins al calvari, dins de les festes patronals de Suera, que s&#39;estendran fins diumenge 2 de novembre amb un variat programa d&#39;actes preparat per la Comissi&oacute;.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16pt;\">La comitiva estava encap&ccedil;alada pel Grup de Dol&ccedil;ainers de Suera i la tancava la banda de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Sueras. Enmig, dos llargues files de persones, algunes amb dos ciris, la reina de les festes, Claudia Ortells Sorribes, i la reina infantil, Denisa Neascu Nae, la Comissi&oacute; de Festes i la Corporaci&oacute; Municipal, amb el seu alcalde, Jos&eacute; Pascual Mart&iacute; Garcia, presidint.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; line-height: 16pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/10/IMG_8527.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\">En arribar al calvari, s&#39;han cantat els gojos, mentre les persones que han volgut han besat els peus o els genolls del Crist. Al final s&#39;ha hagut de c&ograve;rrec cap a les cases, ja que s&#39;ha posat a ploure amb forceta.</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: Arial; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 16pt;\"></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8347.jpg\" alt=\"img_8347\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8349.jpg\" alt=\"img_8349\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8351.jpg\" alt=\"img_8351\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8352.jpg\" alt=\"img_8352\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8355.jpg\" alt=\"img_8355\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8356.jpg\" alt=\"img_8356\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8358.jpg\" alt=\"img_8358\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8359.jpg\" alt=\"img_8359\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8361.jpg\" alt=\"img_8361\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8362.jpg\" alt=\"img_8362\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8363.jpg\" alt=\"img_8363\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8364.jpg\" alt=\"img_8364\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8365.jpg\" alt=\"img_8365\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocristsuera14/img_8366.jpg\" alt=\"img_8366\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processocrists